","email":"73923591+supOS-Project@users.noreply.github.com","name":"supOS-Team"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-06T08:43:06Z","email":"73923591+supOS-Project@users.noreply.github.com","name":"supOS-Team"},"message":"Features & Optimizations\n\nFeatures:\n1. Removed the built-in Hasura service.\n2. Refined the internationalization framework.\n3. Enabled dynamic dashboard creation in the UNS module.\n4. Delivered a system monitoring & management app.\n\nOptimizations:\n1. Enhanced delete prompts for folders/files in the UNS module.\n2. Raised Docker security to support TLS 1.2 certificate-based access.\n3. Strengthened name validation for UNS files, folders, templates, and tags.\n4. Added the ability to edit file properties.\n5. Improved import/export in the UNS module.\n6. Refined support for deleting and updating reference-type files in UNS.\n7. Boosted performance—now handles 20 K data points per second on 2-core/8 GB hardware.\n8. Reduced resource usage, especially CPU and memory.\n9. Streamlined installation scripts.\n10. Enriched OpenAPI—select endpoints now support compressed data transfer.\n\nBug fixes:\n1. Resolved various functional bugs.","tree":{"sha":"b1bf02eecf276f869e82274937dbc9db188e14a0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supOS-Project/supOS-frontend/git/trees/b1bf02eecf276f869e82274937dbc9db188e14a0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/supOS-Project/supOS-frontend/git/commits/03694d712e432b03e234a77f3d938ef7129c77f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/73923591?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supOS-Project/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supOS-Project/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supOS-Project/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/supOS-Project/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https