pi.github.com/users/3zk1m0","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pvarki/python-mediamtx-rmmtxauthz/commits/a9cff27ee0c4fc12e01683adfed4a83297c58601/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-04-11T23:45:09Z","email":"sander.kallio@gmail.com","name":"3zk1m0"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-04-12T08:07:29Z","email":"sander.kallio@gmail.com","name":"3zk1m0"},"message":"feat: redesign MTX UI with stream grid, video page, and broadcast wizard\n\nReplace list-based UI with card grid for streams, dedicated video\nviewer page with connection options dialog, and step-by-step\nbroadcast wizard for OpenTAK ICU, GoPro, UAS Tool and advanced\nprotocol configuration.\n\n- Stream grid with search, loading skeletons, error/empty states\n- Video page with iframe playback, download packages (Browser/VLC/TAK)\n- Broadcast wizard with tool selection and guided setup steps\n- Connection options dialog with credentials, download packages,\n  and collapsible advanced protocol links\n- Shared hooks (useStreams, useCredentials) and utilities\n- Full i18n support (EN/FI/SV) for all new UI text\n- External guide links to docs.pvarki.fi per tool per language\n- Responsive Drawer/Dialog pattern matching rest of system\n- Accessibility: keyboard nav, aria-labels, focus indicators\n- Remove old HomePage, StreamPage, LivePage, stream-list,\n  page-level onboarding (replaced by wizard guides)","tree":{"sha":"e407d43fd9142faeb80baae4ac56b31fe4676be8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pvarki/python-mediamtx-rmmtxauthz/git/trees/e407d43fd9142faeb80baae4ac56b31fe4676be8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pvarki/python-mediamtx-rmmtxauthz/git/commits/a9cff27ee0c4fc12e01683adfed4a83297c58601","verification":{"payload":"tree e407d43fd9142faeb80baae4ac56b31fe4676be8\nparent c8404a0449176595185bec1c9b67f8edf056dfb5\nauthor 3zk1m0 <sander.kallio@gmail.com> 1775951109 +0300\ncommitter 3zk1m0 <sander.kallio@gmail.com> 1775981249 +0300\n\nfeat: redesign MTX UI with stream grid, video page, and broadcast wizard\n\nReplace list-based UI with card grid for streams, dedicated video\nviewer page with connection options dialog, and step-by-step\nbroadcast wizard for OpenTAK ICU, GoPro, UAS Tool and advanced\nprotocol configuration.\n\n- Stream grid with search, loading skeletons, error/empty states\n- Video page with iframe playback, download packages (Browser/VLC/TAK)\n- Broadcast wizard with tool selection and guided setup steps\n- Connection options dialog with credentials, download packages,\n  and collapsible advanced protocol links\n- Shared hooks (useStreams, useCredentials) and utilities\n- Full i18n support (EN/FI/SV) for all new UI text\n- External guide links to docs.pvarki.fi per tool per language\n- Responsive Drawer/Dialog pattern matching rest of system\n- Accessibility: keyboard nav, aria-labels, focus indicators\n- Remove old HomePage, StreamPage, LivePage, stream-list,\n  page-level onboarding (replaced by wizard guides)\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgX7eRjE6nG/oaMctqAtEq7MPMIv\nVqfmK+DNSKgcQGTXEAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMIPSovKuumKqi2o8F7epJ+672uV3CFYXJ0uYqYc0s45aep8XrqXjv8U14275C/YLB\noYh7xOo1DrVLLYCHRUPAE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-04-12T08:25:12Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19320956?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3zk1m0/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3zk1m0/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3zk1m0/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3zk1m0/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/3zk1m0","id":19320956,"login":"3zk1m0","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5MzIwOTU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3zk1m0/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/3zk1m0/received_events","re