com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T17:33:52Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"stillwater: plan questions before asking; fade, never repair (in verification)\n\nA question is planned with its bed of leaves (in view, or ahead by the boat''s\nglide), its water laid in one batch with a spare, and asked only once settled.\nWhile up nothing is supplied; if its leaves are lost it fades and comes back\nlater. The counting loop follows the same rule. No skip button. Choices never\nshow the question''s own numbers; a new missing factor is not the factor shown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ","tree":{"sha":"3181ca4956cf06d5319a8bc99d9ed85f0d3bfff5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/3181ca4956cf06d5319a8bc99d9ed85f0d3bfff5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/266f60fa52419bd5f51261839432c23cb360cf0d","verification":{"payload":"tree 3181ca4956cf06d5319a8bc99d9ed85f0d3bfff5\nparent b8c9d2cc1b04e6f6681a982d0c823dfb7c93c49e\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790789632 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790789632 +0000\n\nstillwater: plan questions before asking; fade, never repair (in verification)\n\nA question is planned with its bed of leaves (in view, or ahead by the boat''s\nglide), its water laid in one batch with a spare, and asked only once settled.\nWhile up nothing is supplied; if its leaves are lost it fades and comes back\nlater. The counting loop follows the same rule. No skip button. Choices never\nshow the question''s own numbers; a new missing factor is not the factor shown.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MT