ser_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/af32190c93ba62ea273dab5f77c50e4f20e6e1d1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:01:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:01:09Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"stillwater: dew is taken by the rising water, not slid off\n\nOn a sinking leaf, dew near the waterline (gShore, the film''s own line) is\ndrawn slightly toward it and taken in: drops shrink into the line, a\nnumeral''s strokes dissolve where the line crosses them. Washed dew is\ntaken by the water''s edge sweeping on across the leaf from the flooded\nside, nearest the flood first. No sliding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ","tree":{"sha":"83ae5fda44ad5a802de3bcc8621d03b356b88d56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/83ae5fda44ad5a802de3bcc8621d03b356b88d56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/af32190c93ba62ea273dab5f77c50e4f20e6e1d1","verification":{"payload":"tree 83ae5fda44ad5a802de3bcc8621d03b356b88d56\nparent 279afc6a08303883df7bfbbda5466eb9d24a5679\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790769669 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790769669 +0000\n\nstillwater: dew is taken by the rising water, not slid off\n\nOn a sinking leaf, dew near the waterline (gShore, the film''s own line) is\ndrawn slightly toward it and taken in: drops shrink into the line, a\nnumeral''s strokes dissolve where the line crosses them. Washed dew is\ntaken by the water''s edge sweeping on across the leaf from the flooded\nside, nearest the flood first. No sliding.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ\n","reason":"valid","signature":