https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/0dfd6f6fcc49e704d37d39430501895323f85822/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:52:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T11:52:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"stillwater: dew is always somewhere — fine dew, and dew that gathers from it\n\nA leaf''s water is nothing, fine dew (tiny uncountable beads), drops or a\nnumeral, and changes only by flowing. About half the leaves keep fine dew\n(by seed). Drops and numerals gather out of fine dew — beads drift toward\nthe nearest drop or down the numeral''s path and swell (2.8 s); a bare leaf\nbeads first (3.2 s) then gathers (queued flow); leaving water returns to\nfine dew on leaves that keep it. Realigning dew for a question is beads\ndrawing together, not drops appearing. Fine dew at rest renders in one\npass.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ","tree":{"sha":"bd2bff44