users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/1d8b184b6ed6e6bb02d0c6e39ca24adb66900519/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:42:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T10:42:07Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"stillwater: dew first, then numerals — leaves show numbers once a skill is proved with dew\n\nConcrete, then abstract, paced by the child''s own evidence: after four\nclean answers to a skill with the leaves as dew (Evidence.dew,\nNUMERALS_AFTER), that skill''s questions show every dewy leaf in the working\narea as its numeral in water, flowing back to dew afterwards. As numerals,\nparts can be larger (fewer leaves) and equal groups can be 7, 8 or 9 (never\nmore than six leaves), which dots on a leaf cannot show; numeral leaves are\nlaid with exactly their number. The dot picture is not drawn for numeral\nquestions. `?numerals=1` treats every skill as proved; `?ask=` now prefers\nthe current level.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ","tree":{"sha":"0ead81f5580b247906aa58d5048407b2b56307c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/0ead81f5580b247906aa58d5048407b2b56307c2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/1d8b184b6ed6e6bb02d0c6e39ca24adb66900519","verification":{"payload":"tree 0ead81f5580b247906aa58d5048407b2b56307c2\nparent e3a5e399f414bc54e6632bdd3caccf1d67ad7213\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790764927 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790764927 +0000\n\nstillwater: dew first, then numerals — leaves show numbers once a skill is proved with dew\n\nConcrete, then abstract, paced by the child''s own evidence: after four\nclean answers to a skill with the leaves as dew (Evidence.dew,\nNUMERALS_AFTER), that skill''s questions show every dewy leaf in the working\narea as its numeral in water, flowing back to dew afterwards. As numerals,\nparts can be larger (fewer leaves) and equal groups can be 7, 8 or 9 (never\nmore than six leaves), which dots on a leaf cannot show; numeral leaves are\nlaid with exactly their number. The dot picture is not drawn for numeral\nquestions. `?numerals=1` treats every skill as proved; `?ask=` now prefers\nthe current level.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQIQcXoj5\n8XjV1a2hQl11SYOpY7NpkhQKWj5+HfTDHPT6nd0Bo5UPFCcKrPE7HDkY0e0iL5sckgQUptvj9F+P\nfwc=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T10:42:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://gi