/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/christopherdebeer/workspace/commit/f89d9698589b2b95301bc7fd5f41039166970b54","node_id":"C_kwDOORTQmNoAKGY4OWQ5Njk4NTg5YjJiOTUzMDFiYzdmZDVmNDEwMzkxNjY5NzBiNTQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christopherdebeer/workspace/commit/7efc48fc2e438f368ec082073a4582d205018a4c","sha":"7efc48fc2e438f368ec082073a4582d205018a4c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/7efc48fc2e438f368ec082073a4582d205018a4c"}],"sha":"f89d9698589b2b95301bc7fd5f41039166970b54","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/f89d9698589b2b95301bc7fd5f41039166970b54"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/7efc48fc2e438f368ec082073a4582d205018a4c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:06:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T09:06:39Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"stillwater: a finger presses a leaf; white water under the blade; the thread reaches the last leaf\n\n- A tap on a dry leaf fired the open-water splash (strength 2.6), which set\n  sink straight to 1. Now a tap only dips the leaf (~0.2), and a finger left\n  on it presses it down through load like the hull, gentler (Pond.held):\n  deeper the longer it is held (~1.5 s to put it under), and a leaf held\n  under stays down longer before it drains and rises.\n- White water on a leaf: the blade''s foam impulse was skipped whenever the\n  blade was over a leaf, and a splash on a leaf returned before pushing\n  any, so only rim froth outside the leaf existed and the flooded film\n  (PAD_FS, Round 55) had nothing to show. The blade now churns at its tip\n  on a leaf too, and a foaming splash on a leaf churns where it lands.\n- The thread was cleared the moment the last leaf solved the ask, so that\n  leaf never got its line (a two-leaf answer never showed one at all). The\n  solved thread now stays through the last leaf for the 0.9 s the leaves\n  glow.\n- tests/stillwater-press.test.ts: tap depth, depth grows with hold, longer\n  hold stays down longer, foam where a blade strikes a leaf.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ","tree":{"sha":"607f27fda674d5bff8ba98016c4404132ae2c66d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/607f27fda674d5bff8ba98016c4404132ae2c66d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/7efc48fc2e438f368ec082073a4582d205018a4c","verification":{"payload":"tree 607f27fda674d5bff8ba98016c4404132ae2c66d\nparent 20859067f811779fd5cbb82edc56af7764f3363d\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790759199 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790759199 +0000\n\nstillwater: a finger presses a leaf; white water under the blade; the thread reaches the last leaf\n\n- A tap on a dry leaf fired the open-water splash (strength 2.6), which set\n  sink straight to 1. Now a tap only dips the leaf (~0.2), and a finger left\n  on it presses it down through load like the hull, gentler (Pond.held):\n  deeper the longer it is held (~1.5 s to put it under), and a leaf held\n  under stays down longer before it drains and rises.\n- White water on a leaf: the blade''s foam impulse was skipped whenever the\n  blade was over a leaf, and a splash on a leaf returned before pushing\n  any, so only rim froth outside the leaf existed and the flooded film\n  (PAD_FS, Round 55) had nothing to show. The blade now churns at its tip\n  on a leaf too, and a foaming splash on a leaf churns where it lands.\n- The thread was cleared the moment the last leaf solved the ask, so that\n  leaf never got its line (a two-leaf answer never showed one at all). The\n  solved thread now stays through the last leaf for the 0.9 s the leaves\n  glow.\n- tests/stillwater-press.test.ts: tap depth, depth grows with hold, longer\n  hold stays down longer, foam where a blade strikes a leaf.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01XpPcniK77FYo3hrbH4MFqQ\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQBdruJ38\n0VZMoF2HrqEA3TYeuJI9M9YXM6gZeBMrhptbmoJyQRxzQD7yPPDUqNoq0lzVTJaT45hUFWDYXYtY\nJgk=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:07:11Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.