 may be denounced: their objective seen\n(Interrogate, Map Fragments, a power), revealed as the enemy, or seen holding an\nitem the enemy objective needs (uncertain — honest players take those to deny\nthem). A wrong accuser''s reveal shows them honest, so it isn''t evidence.\nAAOTE v0.4 games were mostly decided by blind round-3 guesses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"86d3d1e2e5b4cb28edca6e453b4f291daeb05397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/86d3d1e2e5b4cb28edca6e453b4f291daeb05397"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/bc66104aedffc9afc313133bfbd835cd5673882e","verification":{"payload":"tree 86d3d1e2e5b4cb28edca6e453b4f291daeb05397\nparent 771f529ccbe464fb1da0c024e3b9a400b817d48f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790758885 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790758885 +0000\n\nplaytest: denounce.requires_evidence\n\nOnly a player you have evidence on may be denounced: their objective seen\n(Interrogate, Map Fragments, a power), revealed as the enemy, or seen holding an\nitem the enemy objective needs (uncertain — honest players take those to deny\nthem). A wrong accuser''s reveal shows them honest, so it isn''t evidence.\nAAOTE v0.4 games were mostly decided by blind round-3 guesses.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQORcF+Vo\nK4WLC8Ng0p17lJU+JXCQqzuQl4+QZxwGKZAKk2Ko/saxwS/aAYVpMPdnweDGHVOus6FcsUjW5Y4S\nkQ4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T09:02:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuserconten