Y4ZGYzODQzYWVkYjdiMWQxYzJkMWNmOGJiMzM3NmUxMzMyNWIyZDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/christopherdebeer/workspace/commit/69ac7e6651831bcd61571ef2bb716d9b9952d3dd","sha":"69ac7e6651831bcd61571ef2bb716d9b9952d3dd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/69ac7e6651831bcd61571ef2bb716d9b9952d3dd"}],"sha":"68df3843aedb7b1d1c2d1cf8bb3376e13325b2d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/68df3843aedb7b1d1c2d1cf8bb3376e13325b2d5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/69ac7e6651831bcd61571ef2bb716d9b9952d3dd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T08:27:48Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"playtest: AAOTE design pass support; harness h6 (personas); instrument I1 frozen\n\nEngine (for the AAOTE v0.4 redesign, all generic):\n- location cards'' holds: items lying on the tile, taken with search (1 AP);\n  the map shows what lies where.\n- goal metric trade_partners (distinct partners); trades record partners.\n- denounce options from_round and wrong: forfeit (exposed, turn ends, the\n  objective no longer counts).\n- validator: count 0 is a defined-but-never-drawn card.\n\nHarness h6: evals alternate player personas by seed (trusting / suspicious)\nand report scores and outcomes per persona — a rule change that suits only\none kind of player shows up as a split. Instrument I1 (score/v3.1 + h6 +\n24+24) is frozen in ADR-0100. devtools/findings.ts prints classification\nfindings.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"55ec3bbe6f329e1060e9a2664fe100bacc6d4fc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/55ec3bbe6f329e1060e9a2664fe100bacc6d4fc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/69ac7e6651831bcd61571ef2bb716d9b9952d3dd","verification":{"payload":"tree 55ec3bbe6f329e1060e9a2664fe100bacc6d4fc5\nparent a1950e9ff20b6a4ba685cf79bde4e18813e55786\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756868 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790756868 +0000\n\nplaytest: AAOTE design pass support; harness h6 (personas); instrument I1 frozen\n\nEngine (for the AAOTE v0.4 redesign, all generic):\n- location cards'' holds: items lying on the tile, taken with search (1 AP);\n  the map shows what lies where.\n- goal metric trade_partners (distinct partners); trades record partners.\n- denounce options from_round and wrong: forfeit (exposed, turn ends, the\n  objective no longer counts).\n- validator: count 0 is a defined-but-never-drawn card.\n\nHarness h6: evals alternate player personas by seed (trusting / suspicious)\nand report scores and outcomes per persona — a rule change that suits only\none kind of player shows up as a split. Instrument I1 (score/v3.1 + h6 +\n24+24) is frozen in ADR-0100. devtools/findings.ts pr