, balance, rounds, move mix, errors. No Jev, no cost: screen\n  a change''s structure before paying for propose.\n- trade.max_offers_per_turn and trade.counts_for (both | offerer | responder):\n  levers for the Trader''s dominance (13-16 of 24 wins, every accepted open\n  offer counting for both sides).\n- harness h5: option labels drop internal ids, empty values and JSON\n  brackets — the option list is most of a decision''s prompt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"9a11975aa4422ee97d3e55d3f501720ed739e83a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/9a11975aa4422ee97d3e55d3f501720ed739e83a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/85854334fa964e562e62c2a610729de923044c96","verification":{"payload":"tree 9a11975aa4422ee97d3e55d3f501720ed739e83a\nparent ae4350a9611c31295417b45e8f6335a10709f970\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790733513 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790733513 +0000\n\nplaytest: screen tool (free structural preview); trade limits; compact labels (h5)\n\n- screen: N seeded games of rules / a preset / a stored version / edits vs\n  head, played by a greedy stand-in (takes marked progress, else random) —\n  outcomes by role, balance, rounds, move mix, errors. No Jev, no cost: screen\n  a change''s structure before paying for propose.\n- trade.max_offers_per_turn and trade.counts_for (both | offerer | responder):\n  levers for the Trader''s dominance (13-16 of 24 wins, every accepted open\n  offer counting for both sides).\n- harness h5: option labels drop internal ids, empty values and JSON\n  brackets — the option list is most of a decision''s prompt.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0l