imit (win_timeout): AAOTE''s Enemy wins that way by design, and v2 paid 0.3\n  for it — rewarding quick objective wins, i.e. rewarding the imbalance.\n- suite = 0.75 × mean run + 0.15 × definition health + 0.10 × outcome balance\n  (normalised entropy of who won, by secret role else by seat). On the h4\n  baseline the Trader won 13 of 24 train games — v2 couldn''t see it.\n- runs record the positions dealt and the winner''s; evals report train\n  balance; the page explains v3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"2194fb74a965126f736874ede91796c25cff44b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/2194fb74a965126f736874ede91796c25cff44b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/0244ec35c09780dc3357e6c22033ca0b8f2dbbdc","verification":{"payload":"tree 2194fb74a965126f736874ede91796c25cff44b8\nparent 6912f89ec144ee5bb6ab527e9293263a29e5bca8\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790732671 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790732671 +0000\n\nplaytest: score/v3 — designed time-limit wins count; outcome balance in the suite score\n\n- a time-limit end scores as ended-by-rule when the rules name who wins at the\n  limit (win_timeout): AAOTE''s Enemy wins that way by design, and v2 paid 0.3\n  for it — rewarding quick objective wins, i.e. rewarding the imbalance.\n- suite = 0.75 × mean run + 0.15 × definition health + 0.10 × outcome balance\n  (normalised entropy of who won, by secret role else by seat). On the h4\n  baseline the Trader won 13 of 24 train games — v2 couldn''t see it.\n- runs record the positions dealt and the winner''s; evals report train\n  balance; the page explains v3.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU