"events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/2a8c921a827333220c54a958e0c6778e75ae8cbf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:42:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T01:42:30Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"playtest: compact evals in job results (the gateway''s 60 KB read cap)\n\nA 24+24 AAOTE eval''s job result was 72 KB, so every job read came back as the\ngateway''s ''too large'' message and pollers never saw ''done'' (the work itself\nhad completed). Job results and round results now carry a compact eval\n(scores, parts, outcomes, the train critique summary); eval_detail has the\nrest.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"ff6ba86f85fd8a0f0f6ef470ac11222e37fc3190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/ff6ba86f85fd8a0f0f6ef470ac11222e37fc3190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/2a8c921a827333220c54a958e0c6778e75ae8cbf"