6796e2fb48763382b1e2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/dc261b628678e7ca14886796e2fb48763382b1e2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/912f6627d009ae00a4ba930fc7b605cad1128b63","verification":{"payload":"tree dc261b628678e7ca14886796e2fb48763382b1e2\nparent d43d9fd045770386cace77207baaab3713d0045f\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790730032 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790730032 +0000\n\nplaytest: noise is per (engine, harness, suite); a new suite starts unmeasured\n\nset_suite carried the old suite''s noise over, and noise only ever ratcheted up\n(max across contexts): a 0.20 measured on a 6+6 suite that hit the deadline\nkept blocking every proposal on the new 12+12 suite, where it measured 0.049.\nSuites allow up to 48 games now that each run is its own invocation.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgrLzsfFISF4by8Q+FKz27YpkK1USsBB+m\namu1QkJnbDsAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5AAAAQGRHeK3a\nPQbD+88IaabTMPUWanlskPTnLINaQXbNKpI5IR6t+2HcDPjl6qLJIByWhcKIY9MtFTClE4OBRHiy\nRwM=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-30T01:01:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/receive