om/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/1adf178cda70a2b5bf121cb509d5921c763a0df0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:58:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:58:50Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"playtest: engine fingerprint ignores bundler renames; change log names re-fingerprints\n\nThe landing-page deploy moved the engine version with no engine change: the\nbundler''s digit-suffix renames (readFileSync2) shifted when modules were added,\norphaning the fortune-seekers baseline. Strip digit suffixes before hashing\n(old and new bundles now fingerprint identically). An engine version where every\nmechanic hash changed at once is labelled a re-fingerprint, and is left out of\nper-mechanic change history.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"f0c1a523bf00d460f610f905aa5ae4bfc6c711cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/trees/f0c1a523bf00d460f610f905aa5ae4bfc6c711cb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/git/commits/1adf178cda70a2b5bf121cb509d5921c763a0df0","verification":{"payload":"tree f0c1a523bf00d460f610f905aa5ae4bfc6c711cb\nparent 5c7d8180c341b7f6d6a1d427a85c87635f6211c9\nauthor Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790726330 +0000\ncommitter Claude <noreply@anthropic.com> 1790726330 +0000\n\nplaytest: engine fingerprint ignores bundler renames; change log names re-fingerprints\n\nThe landing-page deploy moved the engine version with no engine change: the\nbundler''s digit-suffix renames (readFileSync2) shifted when modules were added,\norphaning the fortune-seekers baseline. Strip digit suffixes before hashing\n(old and new bundles now fingerprint identically). An engine version where every\nmechanic hash 