nt.com/u/81847?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/claude","id":81847,"login":"claude","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxODQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/claude","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/christopherdebeer/workspace/commits/ad476fe3f1ff2fdbcbe0698a79d79189e8296acf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:22:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-29T23:22:34Z","email":"noreply@anthropic.com","name":"Claude"},"message":"cells/playtest: game development by hill-climbing Jev playtests\n\nA new tier-2 cell that owns the playtest engine (vendored from\nchristopherdebeer/playtest@8388ef4; mechanics evolve here and every run\nrecords a code fingerprint of the engine), versioned game definitions,\ntrain/held-out evals under score/v1, one-change-per-round propose with\nkeep/revert and stall detection, and a mechanics backlog ranked by how\noften evals hit each gap. Jev is reached through the /mcp gateway with the\nowner''s scoped token, batched per tick across concurrent games.\n\nAlso: parse ''players: 2-4'' ranges (the engine never does) in both runners.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_011oR3V7hLncLCGgHh8wRUV4","tree":{"sha":"a78ab